Z||000002||87GTBro||07-25-2001||04:59 PM||||Parts for the 88's may cost more but the 88's have a better suspension than pre-88's.  If I found an 88 GT anywhere near me, you can bet money I would try to buy it.<P>Right now I have an 86 GT and just bought an 87 GT so I am working my way up to an 88.<P>If you have a choice... find one that has only been through one or two owners... and pick them carefully cause you dont want one that has been ragged out by some cocky teen (no offense to anybody).<P>The fiero is a good buy, but remember, even the 88's are 13 years old, so there is some upkeep expenses involved :-)...<P>....Edited for spelling....<p>[This message has been edited by 87GTBro (edited 07-25-2001).]||||reg||1
